WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Welcome to My Notes — a 100% free, local-first offline notebook app for iPad, Android tablets, and desktop.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:22.000
On iOS and iPadOS, open My Notes in Safari, tap the Share button in the toolbar, choose Add to Home Screen, and tap Add.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:36.000
On Android tablets and phones, open My Notes in Chrome, tap the three-dot menu, and choose Install app or Add to Home screen.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Create a custom notebook with Blank, Ruled, Grid, or Dotted paper — or upload a custom photo cover — then write with custom pen styles and colors.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Use the Lasso tool to select handwriting, convert ink to editable font text (or download the offline TrOCR pack), and choose built-in or custom .TTF/.OTF fonts.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Optionally protect any individual notebook or page with a password from the three-dot menu. Unprotected notebooks continue to open normally.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:28.000
All notes stay stored locally on your device. Export vector PDFs or full .tabletnotes.zip backups anytime. Made by Md samiul Islam.
